{"name":"Unseen, Unheard – Queer Vilnius Installation","aliases":["Nematyta negirdėta 2026","Unseen Unheard Kreives 2026"],"city":"vilnius","date":"2026-09-05","start_date":"2026-09-05","end_date":"2026-09-09","description":"Kristijonas Dirsė's spatial audiovisual installation maps personal testimony onto scanned Vilnius locations to explore queer visibility, memory and urban erasure.","link":"https://festivaliskreives.lt/en/renginys/unseen-unheard/","ticket_url":"https://festivaliskreives.lt/en/renginys/unseen-unheard/","location":"Meno avilys, A. Goštauto g. 2, Vilnius, Lithuania","lat":54.6898,"lng":25.2705,"vibe":"immersive queer memory work turning city locations and testimony into spatial sound","intel":{"entry_wait":"The launch begins at 17:30 on 5 September; subsequent viewing runs daily from 16:00–19:00 through 9 September.","best_arrival":"Attend the launch for context from the creators or arrive early within later three-hour windows to experience the work without rushing.","crowd_mix":"Queer Vilnius residents, installation-art audiences, researchers, activists, students and festival visitors share the work.","dress_code":"No dress requirement applies; quiet, comfortable gallery clothing suits an attentive audiovisual experience.","host_inclusivity":"The project was developed with LGBTQ+ researchers, activists and artists and directly centres nine queer community testimonies.","source_urls":["https://festivaliskreives.lt/en/renginys/unseen-unheard/"],"research_status":"official_festival_dates_daily_hours_venue_method_and_community_collaboration_verified","updated_at":"2026-08-29T00:00:00Z"}},
